flowchart TD
    subgraph CI["1. GitHub Actions CI (ci.yml)"]
        A[Git Push / PR to main] --> B1[Job: backend-test\nmvnw verify]
        A --> B2[Job: frontend-build\nnpm ci && npm run build]
        A --> B3[Job: deployment-config\nValidate Compose + Nginx -t + Bash -n]
        B1 & B3 --> C{Push to main?}
        C -- Yes --> D[Job: backend-image\nBuild Docker image & Push to Docker Hub\nTag: sha-commit]
    end

    subgraph CD["2. GitHub Actions CD (cd.yml)"]
        D --> E[Trigger CD Pipeline\nCheck GCP_DEPLOY_ENABLED == true]
        E --> F[SSH Setup & Package deploy bundle\nauction-deploy-sha.tgz]
        F --> G[SCP bundle to GCP VM /tmp]
        G --> H[SSH Remote Execution\nExtract to /srv/auction/releases/sha]
    end

    subgraph VM["3. GCP VM Execution (deploy.sh)"]
        H --> I[Flock Lock\nChống trùng lặp deploy]
        I --> J[preflight.sh\nCheck Docker, Volume, Disk space, SSL Certs]
        J --> K[backup-postgres.sh\nDump + Verify pg_restore list + SHA256]
        K --> L[docker compose pull backend]
        L --> M[Start postgres & redis -> Wait healthy]
        M --> N[Start new backend container -> Wait healthy]
        N -- Failed --> O[rollback_backend to previous_tag]
        N -- OK --> P[Start nginx -> Health check]
        P --> Q[Public HTTPS Healthcheck /healthz]
        Q -- Failed --> O
        Q -- OK --> R[Rotate current/previous image tags\nKeep two backend images only]
    end
